{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22169","headline":"东园玩菊 · 白居易","name":"东园玩菊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年昨已去，芳岁今又阑。\n如何寂莫意，复此荒凉园。\n园中独立久，日澹风露寒。\n秋蔬尽芜没，好树亦凋残。\n唯有数丛菊，新开篱落间。\n携觞聊就酌，爲尔一留连。\n忆我少小日，易爲兴所牵。\n见酒无时节，未饮已欣然。\n近从年长来，渐觉取乐难。\n常恐更衰老，强饮亦无欢。\n顾谓尔菊花，後时何独鲜。\n诚知不爲我，借尔暂开颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22169.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22169","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}